Sorry. Yes, go ahead.

00:54:25.050 --> 00:54:26.070
- [Ursula] Hi, my name is Ursula,

00:54:26.070 --> 00:54:27.780
I'm also a computer science student here.

00:54:27.780 --> 00:54:30.210
I was wondering if you had any things

00:54:30.210 --> 00:54:32.718
that were top of mind,
relating to the intersection

00:54:32.718 --> 00:54:35.550
of cybersecurity and generative AI

00:54:35.550 --> 00:54:36.660
and is there something

00:54:36.660 --> 00:54:38.700
that you think Amazon should be working on

00:54:38.700 --> 00:54:42.480
that they aren't pursuing at the moment?

00:54:42.480 --> 00:54:45.690
- Oh, so, I won't talk
about all our roadmap stuff

00:54:45.690 --> 00:54:48.780
and there's a lot of work we are doing

00:54:48.780 --> 00:54:52.470
that we'll bring out
in the course of time.

00:54:52.470 --> 00:54:56.223
I think generative AI and cybersecurity,

00:54:57.510 --> 00:55:00.360
cybersecurity I think will
get a lot more interesting

00:55:00.360 --> 00:55:02.790
with generative AI, in two different ways.

00:55:02.790 --> 00:55:07.790
One is bad actors can use generative AI

00:55:07.939 --> 00:55:12.843
to create more of these threats.

00:55:16.860 --> 00:55:20.430
More threats that compromise systems.

00:55:20.430 --> 00:55:22.140
And so there's that aspect

00:55:22.140 --> 00:55:25.470
where they now have a new set of tools.

00:55:25.470 --> 00:55:27.150
Now there's the other aspect of it,

00:55:27.150 --> 00:55:31.320
which is you can use AI in
general and generative AI also,

00:55:31.320 --> 00:55:35.580
to be monitoring systems and
to be raising the barriers

00:55:35.580 --> 00:55:37.500
to people getting in.

00:55:37.500 --> 00:55:39.326
So I think there's both aspects of it

00:55:39.326 --> 00:55:41.070
and I think there's work to be done,

00:55:41.070 --> 00:55:43.980
including a lot of very
interesting research to be done

00:55:43.980 --> 00:55:45.540
at the intersection of the two.

00:55:45.540 --> 00:55:50.340
And I suspect there's a lot
of very interesting research

00:55:50.340 --> 00:55:51.190
to be done there.

